{
  "name": "Create a Google Drive Folder for Every New Client",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "70c0dbb6-b9ba-4385-bdbd-56d888d9d39a",
      "name": "Overview and Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 680,
        "height": 720,
        "content": "# Create a Google Drive Folder for Every New Client\n\nThis beginner-friendly workflow gives every new client a consistent Google Drive home as soon as they submit a short intake form. It is designed for freelancers and small agencies that want organized client files without a separate form service, CRM, AI, paid API, or community node.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Collect Client Details** displays an n8n Form for Name, Email, and Company.\n2. **Normalize Client Data** trims values, collapses repeated spaces, converts email to lowercase, and creates a safe folder name in `YYYY-MM-DD - Company - Name` format.\n3. **Create Client Folder** creates the folder inside the Google Drive parent folder selected during setup.\n4. **Return Folder Details** provides the normalized client fields, created folder name, Google Drive folder ID, and a direct folder URL for later workflow steps.\n\n### Setup\n1. Open **Create Client Folder** and connect your Google Drive OAuth2 credential.\n2. Choose the Parent Drive and Parent Folder where client folders should be created.\n3. Start a test execution, open the Form Trigger test URL, and submit sample client details.\n4. Confirm the new folder appears in the selected parent and review the final output.\n\n### Requirements\nAn n8n account or self-hosted instance, a Google account, and access to Google Drive.\n\n### Customization\nChange the folder naming expression, form fields, or final output fields to match your onboarding process. Each submission creates a new folder; duplicate detection is intentionally not included."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "b3b7a2bc-75e7-4f5b-8a79-6eacd88533c5",
      "name": "Client Folder Flow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        784,
        272
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1440,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Client folder flow\nForm submission → normalized client data and safe folder name → Google Drive folder → reusable folder details."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "46d6255f-2d00-43d5-a599-afbc21b228dd",
      "name": "Collect Client Details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "position": [
        928,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "buttonLabel": "Create folder",
          "respondWithOptions": {
            "values": {
              "formSubmittedText": "Thanks! The client folder workflow has started."
            }
          }
        },
        "formTitle": "New Client Folder",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldName": "name",
              "fieldLabel": "Name",
              "placeholder": "Full name",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "fieldLabel": "Email",
              "placeholder": "user@example.com",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldName": "company",
              "fieldLabel": "Company",
              "placeholder": "Company name",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "formDescription": "Add the client details used to create a dedicated Google Drive folder."
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.6
    },
    {
      "id": "4d9c73cc-14e0-4248-9cef-b94d759209d7",
      "name": "Normalize Client Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1264,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "bb21c173-c19e-4a3a-b990-8df3f57741b8",
              "name": "clientName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ String($json.name ?? '').trim().replace(/\\s+/g, ' ') }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "10969adc-b90c-4a93-9010-9be3c42bd3b1",
              "name": "email",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ String($json.email ?? '').trim().toLowerCase() }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "b70fb8ee-d36b-4ddc-899d-7ecfd342da6d",
              "name": "company",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ String($json.company ?? '').trim().replace(/\\s+/g, ' ') }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "16f26ec5-a0be-44b1-b091-a76721d16e15",
              "name": "folderName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ [$now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd'), String($json.company ?? '').replace(/[\\\\/:*?\"<>|\\u0000-\\u001F]+/g, ' ').trim().replace(/\\s+/g, ' '), String($json.name ?? '').replace(/[\\\\/:*?\"<>|\\u0000-\\u001F]+/g, ' ').trim().replace(/\\s+/g, ' ')].filter(Boolean).join(' - ').slice(0, 180) }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.5
    },
    {
      "id": "648a95a1-61c2-40ad-9c85-39aacdfa39b5",
      "name": "Create Client Folder",
